/**
 * @module nexus-cx/classifier/taxonomy
 * @description Static intent taxonomy for the deterministic classifier. Contains 19 domains,
 * 82 intents, and 629 exemplar phrases derived from historical CX interaction mining.
 *
 * This is the "frozen taxonomy" that the classifier runs against. In production, this
 * would be generated by an LLM-driven taxonomy discovery pipeline and versioned in a
 * configuration store. Locally, it serves as the ground truth for both TF-IDF and
 * embedding-based classification.
 *
 * Domain groups:
 *   - **Commercial CX** (5 domains, 20 intents): billing, technical_support, account, sales, general
 *   - **Treasury Core** (5 domains, 20 intents): tax_payments, savings_bonds, treasury_payments,
 *     debt_collection, currency_compliance
 *   - **Treasury Expanded** (9 domains, 42 intents): tax_filing, tax_identity, tax_compliance,
 *     treasury_accounts, foreign_tax, financial_crimes, government_payments, estate_gift_tax, business_tax
 *
 * Each intent entry contains:
 *   - `intent` {string} — unique intent identifier (e.g., 'billing_dispute')
 *   - `exemplars` {string[]} — training phrases for TF-IDF and embedding index
 *
 * @see {@link module:nexus-cx/classifier/classifier} Classifier (consumer)
 * @see {@link module:nexus-cx/classifier/reranker} Reranker (consumer)
 */

